{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-02-02 22:34:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE MARCH 13, 2023 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 2, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOUTHWEST INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF TEXAS. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-02-02 20:46:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 2, 2023) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER SOUTHWEST AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-02-02 11:00:00', 'title': 'LUV INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST AIRLINES" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV). CLASS PERIOD: JUNE 13, 2020 – DECEMBER 31, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: MARCH 13, 2023 IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF OF THE SOUTHWEST AIRLINES LAWSUIT, YOU CAN SUBMIT YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AT WWW.GLANCYLAW.COM/CASES/